[50.072558, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll create the package with setuptools metadata, build a wheel, generate a PEP 503-compatible static index, serve it on port 8080, and then test installation \r\nthrough pip.\r\n\r\n```\r\nmkdir -p /app/vectorops /app/pypi/packages /app/pypi/simple/vectorops\r\ncat <<'EOF' > /app/vectorops/__init__.py\r\n\"\"\"A small vector operations package.\"\"\"\r\n\r\n__version__ = \"0.1.0\"\r\n\r\n\r\ndef dotproduct(a, b):\r\n    \"\"\"Return the dot product of two lists of numbers.\"\"\"\r\n    if len(a) != len(b):\r\n        raise ValueError(\"vectors must have the same length\")\r\n    return sum(x * y for x, y in zip(a, b))\r\nEOF\r\ncat <<'EOF' > /app/pyproject.toml\r\n[build-system]\r\nrequires = [\"setuptools>=61\", \"wheel\"]\r\nbuild-backend = \"setuptools.build_meta\"\r\n\r\n[project]\r\nname = \"vectorops\"\r\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\r\ndescription = \"A small vector operations package\"\r\nrequires-python = \">=3.8\"\r\n\r\n[tool.setuptools]\r\npackages = [\"vectorops\"]\r\nEOF\r\ncat <<'EOF' > /app/README.md\r\n# vectorops\r\n\r\nA small Python package providing a `dotproduct` function.\r\nEOF\r\ncd /app"]
[50.072568, "o", " && python3 -m pip wheel . --no-deps --no-build-isolation -w /app/pypi/packages\r\nls -la /app/pypi/packages\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
